-- GMeterWindow.dlg
-- Install to: Saved Games/DCS/Scripts/GMeter/GMeterWindow.dlg
--
-- Five elements. GMeter.lua sizes, positions and colours all of them at
-- runtime, so every bound and colour here is a dead starting value. Change
-- appearance in the layout block of Config/GMeterConfig.lua, not here.
--
-- This file is structural only: it declares that FillUp, FillDown, Cap,
-- ZeroMark and Tick exist and what type they are. Renaming any of them
-- breaks the lookup in GMeter.lua.
--
-- Structure follows Mods/tech/Supercarrier/PLATCameraUI/FLOLS.dlg: Static
-- elements with a staticSkin and a nine-slot bkg.

